{"seq":2,"slug":"visual-tokenization","title":"视觉 token 化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-language-models/architecture/visual-tokenization","wordCount":1538,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"视觉-token-化\">视觉 token 化</h1><p>把一张 4K 截图原封不动喂给 VLM，视觉编码器可能吐出上万个 token——比整段用户提示还长几十倍，推理延迟和显存随之爆炸，而其中绝大多数 token 落在空白背景上毫无信息。视觉 token 的数量，是 VLM 工程里最直接影响成本与效果的旋钮：太多则慢且贵、挤占上下文，太少则丢细节、答不准。本篇专讲这个旋钮怎么调——token 数从何而来、如何压缩、如何剪枝，正面回应基础章 <a href=\"../foundations/modality-alignment\">模态对齐挑战</a> 里「视觉信息密度悬殊、冗余巨大」的错位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-token-数的平方诅咒\">核心概念：token 数的平方诅咒</h2><p>视觉 token 数由分辨率和 patch 尺寸决定。边长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 的方图、patch 边长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，token 数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\left(\\frac{R}{p}\\right)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>平方关系是一切问题的根源。336×336、patch 14，得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>24</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>576</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24^2=576</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">576</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token；但要看清密集文字把分辨率提到 1008×1008，token 数立刻变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>72</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5184</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72^2=5184</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5184</span></span></span></span></span>——9 倍。而 LLM 自注意力对序列长度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(L^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，5184 个视觉 token 让注意力计算量相对 576 时暴涨约 81 倍。这就是「平方诅咒」：分辨率线性提升，token 数平方膨胀，注意力成本再平方膨胀。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R[分辨率提升] --&gt; N[视觉 token 数&lt;br/&gt;平方增长]&#10;  N --&gt; CTX[挤占 LLM 上下文窗口]&#10;  N --&gt; COST[注意力成本&lt;br/&gt;O 序列长度平方]&#10;  N --&gt; PRESS{压力}&#10;  PRESS --&gt; COMP[压缩:像素重排/池化]&#10;  PRESS --&gt; PRUNE[剪枝:丢冗余 token]&#10;  COMP --&gt; FEWER[更少 token]&#10;  PRUNE --&gt; FEWER&#10;  FEWER --&gt; BALANCE[细节与效率的平衡点]\">flowchart TD\n  R[分辨率提升] --&gt; N[视觉 token 数&lt;br/&gt;平方增长]\n  N --&gt; CTX[挤占 LLM 上下文窗口]\n  N --&gt; COST[注意力成本&lt;br/&gt;O 序列长度平方]\n  N --&gt; PRESS{压力}\n  PRESS --&gt; COMP[压缩:像素重排/池化]\n  PRESS --&gt; PRUNE[剪枝:丢冗余 token]\n  COMP --&gt; FEWER[更少 token]\n  PRUNE --&gt; FEWER\n  FEWER --&gt; BALANCE[细节与效率的平衡点]</pre><p>所以 VLM 设计的一大半工作，就是在不丢关键细节的前提下把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 压下来。压缩与剪枝是两类手段，下面分别讲。怎样在「需要看清」时反而要提分辨率（再用切块控制 token），是 <a href=\"high-resolution-tiling\">高分辨率与切块</a> 的主题；本篇先解决「同一张图如何少花 token」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压缩之一-像素重排与池化\">压缩之一：像素重排与池化</h2><p>最常用、最稳的压缩是在进 LLM 前就把相邻 patch 合并。Qwen2.5-VL 把空间上相邻的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 共四个 patch 特征拼接（concat）成一个，再过两层 MLP——token 数直接降到 1/4，这就是它宣称的 75% 视觉 token 压缩。这种「空间感知池化」保留了局部结构（合并的是相邻块，不是随机块），细节损失可控。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>压缩手段</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>压缩比</th>\n<th>细节损失</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>像素重排（pixel shuffle）</td>\n<td>相邻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> patch 拼接</td>\n<td>4×</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Qwen2.5-VL、InternVL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均/最大池化</td>\n<td>空间下采样 patch 网格</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多种 VLM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q-Former 重采样</td>\n<td>可学习 query 采样到固定数</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>BLIP-2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频域压缩</td>\n<td>在频域丢高频系数</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Fourier-VLM（2025）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>像素重排和 Q-Former 的区别值得点明：像素重排是确定性的、无参数的空间合并，便宜且稳；Q-Former 是可学习的内容自适应采样，更灵活但要训练、有损，这条对比在 <a href=\"connector-architectures\">连接器架构</a> 里从连接器视角讲过，本篇从 token 预算视角再看一遍——同一设计在不同章节回应不同问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压缩之二-训练-free-的-token-剪枝\">压缩之二：训练-free 的 token 剪枝</h2><p>压缩在编码阶段就减 token，剪枝则是在推理时动态丢弃「看上去没用」的 token，且很多方法不需要重新训练。核心观察是：视觉 token 高度冗余，背景、重复纹理对应的 token 对最终答案贡献极小，可以安全丢掉。</p>\n<p>2025–2026 涌现了一批训练-free 剪枝方法。一类是<strong>注意力引导</strong>：用 LLM 浅层对各视觉 token 的注意力权重当重要性分数，分数低的直接删，越深层保留越少。一类是<strong>提示感知</strong>（如 ZSPAPrune，2025）：根据用户问题动态决定哪些视觉 token 相关——问「左下角写了什么」就保留左下区域的 token、丢其余。还有从推理目标出发重新审视剪枝时机的工作（如 PIO-FVLM，2026）。这些方法能在几乎不掉精度的前提下砍掉一半以上视觉 token，是上线优化的实用工具。剪枝带来的推理加速，与服务层的批处理、KV cache 优化叠加效果更佳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么选-一个决策框架\">怎么选：一个决策框架</h2><p>面对一个具体 VLM 应用，token 预算该怎么定？给一个实用的决策顺序。第一问任务类型：纯场景描述、情感判断这类「看个大概」的任务，token 可以压得很狠（如池化到 144 个）；OCR、表格、图表、小目标定位这类「抠细节」的任务，token 要给足甚至要提分辨率。第二问延迟预算：实时交互（GUI 代理逐帧看屏）必须狠压并配合剪枝，离线批处理可以放宽。第三问上下文压力：多图对话、长文档 OCR 里视觉 token 会累加挤爆窗口，这种场景压缩优先级最高。</p>\n<p>把这三问走一遍，再决定「压缩比 + 是否剪枝 + 分辨率档位」。值得记住的核心权衡用一句话概括：视觉 token 是 VLM 里最贵的 token，每多一个都在花注意力预算，所以压缩不是可选优化而是默认动作——区别只在压多狠。这个权衡贯穿评测（token 数影响成本/分）与应用（代理对延迟敏感），分别见 <a href=\"../practice/vlm-evaluation\">VLM 评测</a> 与 <a href=\"../practice/vlm-applications-agents\">应用与视觉代理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>视觉 token 数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=(R/p)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随分辨率平方增长，注意力成本再随之平方膨胀，这个「平方诅咒」是 token 化一切设计的根源。</li>\n<li>压缩在编码阶段减 token：像素重排（相邻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 拼接，4× 压缩，细节损失低）最常用，另有池化、Q-Former、频域压缩。</li>\n<li>剪枝在推理阶段动态丢冗余 token，2025–2026 的训练-free 方法（注意力引导、提示感知如 ZSPAPrune）能砍半 token 而几乎不掉精度。</li>\n<li>选 token 预算看三问：任务是「看大概」还是「抠细节」、延迟预算、上下文压力；视觉 token 最贵，压缩是默认动作而非可选项。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/modality-alignment\">模态对齐挑战</a>、<a href=\"connector-architectures\">连接器架构</a>、<a href=\"high-resolution-tiling\">高分辨率与切块</a>、<a href=\"../practice/vlm-applications-agents\">应用与视觉代理</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../multimodal-ai/multimodal-foundations/modality-and-representation\">文本嵌入与表示</a>（多模态 AI hub，模态表示的一般框架）</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../computer-vision/image-fundamentals/image-preprocessing\">图像预处理</a>（计算机视觉 hub，分辨率与下采样的视觉基础）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Qwen2.5-VL 75% token 压缩与像素重排（promptquorum.com Local Vision Models 2026）、提示感知剪枝（arxiv 2510.17197 ZSPAPrune）、推理目标剪枝（arxiv 2602.04657 PIO-FVLM）、频域压缩（arxiv 2508.06038 Fourier-VLM）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"视觉 token 化","id":"视觉-token-化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：token 数的平方诅咒","id":"核心概念-token-数的平方诅咒"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩之一：像素重排与池化","id":"压缩之一-像素重排与池化"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩之二：训练-free 的 token 剪枝","id":"压缩之二-训练-free-的-token-剪枝"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么选：一个决策框架","id":"怎么选-一个决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"连接器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-language-models/architecture/connector-architectures"},"next":{"title":"高分辨率与切块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-language-models/architecture/high-resolution-tiling"}}